              </div>
              <div class="nabla-soap-box">
                <div class="nabla-soap-row">
                  <span class="nabla-soap-tag tag-s">S</span>
                  <div class="nabla-soap-text">
                    <strong>Subjective:</strong> 52-year-old male with known Type 2 DM and HTN presents for follow-up. Reports mild morning dizziness; denies syncope, chest pain, or shortness of breath. Known Penicillin anaphylaxis.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="nabla-soap-row">
                  <span class="nabla-soap-tag tag-o">O</span>
                  <div class="nabla-soap-text">
                    <strong>Objective:</strong> BP: 138/88 mmHg. Fasting Blood Glucose: <mark class="nabla-mark-high">154 mg/dL (HIGH)</mark>. HbA1c: <mark class="nabla-mark-high">7.8% (HIGH)</mark>. Serum Creatinine: <mark class="nabla-mark-alert">1.35 mg/dL (ELEVATED)</mark>.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="nabla-soap-row">
                  <span class="nabla-soap-tag tag-a">A</span>
